    {
      "id": "ember_ovid_stair_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Cut.” He does not elaborate until you wait. “Not melted through — cut, with tools, and then the glass came up around the cut. You can see the tool marks in the sides of it under the glass.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "ember_sheet_stair"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_ovid_stair_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_ovid_stair_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_vent_readers",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ember_ovid_stair_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ember_ovid_flat_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Which is the part nobody will discuss.” He puts the blade down. “Lava pools. It cracks, it goes where the ground takes it, it is never flat. That is flat to the width of my rule over a mile.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "ember_sheet_flat"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
